## 3. ESSENTIAL FUNCTIONS (Top 20)

### Array Operations

| Function | Purpose | Example |
|----------|---------|---------|
| `map` | Transform each element | `items map ((i) -> {id: i.id})` |
| `filter` | Keep matching elements | `items filter ($.active)` |
| `reduce` | Aggregate to single value | `items reduce ((i, acc=0) -> acc + i.amount)` |
| `flatMap` | Map and flatten | `orders flatMap $.items` |
| `groupBy` | Group by key | `items groupBy $.category` |
| `orderBy` | Sort elements | `items orderBy $.name` |
| `distinctBy` | Remove duplicates | `items distinctBy $.id` |
| `sizeOf` | Count elements | `sizeOf(items)` |

### String Operations

| Function | Purpose | Example |
|----------|---------|---------|
| `upper` | Uppercase | `upper("hello")` → "HELLO" |
| `lower` | Lowercase | `lower("HELLO")` → "hello" |
| `trim` | Remove whitespace | `trim(" hello ")` → "hello" |
| `++` | Concatenate | `"Hello" ++ " World"` |
| `splitBy` | Split string | `"a,b,c" splitBy ","` |
| `joinBy` | Join array | `["a","b"] joinBy ","` |
| `replace` | Replace pattern | `"hello" replace "l" with "L"` |

### Type & Null Operations

| Function | Purpose | Example |
|----------|---------|---------|
| `as` | Type coercion | `x as Number default 0` |
| `default` | Null fallback | `x default "N/A"` |
| `isEmpty` | Check empty | `isEmpty(payload.items)` |
| `isBlank` | Check blank string | `isBlank(payload.name)` |

> **Full Reference**: `lib/docs/functions-reference.md`

