## 4. XML PROCESSING ESSENTIALS

### Namespace Declaration

```dataweave
%dw 2.0
ns ns0 http://example.com/schema
output application/xml
---
{
    ns0#Root: {
        ns0#Element: payload.data
    }
}
```

### Common XML Patterns

| Pattern | Syntax |
|---------|--------|
| Attribute access | `payload.element.@attributeName` |
| CDATA output | `output application/xml cdata=["fieldName"]` |
| Namespace prefix | `ns0#ElementName` |
| Remove namespace | `payload.element.*` |

> **Full Reference**: `lib/docs/xml-processing.md`

