## 5. ERROR TROUBLESHOOTING (Top 10)

| Error | Cause | Fix |
|-------|-------|-----|
| `Unable to coerce Null` | Null in type coercion | Add `default` operator |
| `Cannot coerce Null to Number` | Null in arithmetic | Use `default 0` |
| `Unrecognized selector` | Wrong field path | Check input structure |
| `Cannot cast X to Y` | Type mismatch | Use explicit `as Type` |
| `Invalid input` | Malformed JSON/XML | Validate input format |
| `Index out of bounds` | Array access beyond size | Check `sizeOf()` first |
| `Expecting type X, found Y` | Wrong data type | Add type coercion |
| `Cannot read property` | Null object navigation | Use `?.` or `default` |
| `Duplicate key` | Same key in object | Use `groupBy` or rename |
| `Stack overflow` | Recursive loop | Limit recursion depth |

> **Full Reference**: `lib/docs/error-troubleshooting.md`

