## 7. QUALITY & SECURITY

### Quality Gates Summary

| Check | Threshold | Action |
|-------|-----------|--------|
| Security Score | ≥ 98/100 | Review and fix |
| Hardcode Detection | 0 violations | Remove hardcoded values |
| Output Accuracy | ≥ 95% | Adjust transformation |

### Hardcode Detection Patterns

| ❌ Violation | ✅ Compliant |
|--------------|--------------|
| `default "2025-01-01"` | `default now()` |
| `default 100` | `default 0` |
| `default "USD"` | `default null` or from config |
| `if (x == "ACTIVE")` | `if (x == vars.activeStatus)` |

> **Full Reference**: `lib/docs/quality-security.md`

