## 8. PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZATION

### Streaming (Large Datasets >10MB)

```dataweave
%dw 2.0
output application/json deferred=true
---
payload.largeArray map ((item) -> { ... })
```

### Import Efficiency

```dataweave
// ❌ BAD: Import everything
import * from dw::core::Arrays

// ✅ GOOD: Import only what you use
import take from dw::core::Arrays
```

### Memory Patterns

| Pattern | Recommendation |
|---------|----------------|
| Large arrays | Use streaming output |
| Nested loops | Flatten or use reduce |
| Multiple passes | Combine into single pass |

> **Full Reference**: `lib/docs/performance-optimization.md`

