## 9. TRANSFORMATION PATTERNS

### Simple Map
```dataweave
payload.items map ((item) -> {
    id: item.id,
    name: item.name,
    total: (item.price as Number default 0) * (item.qty as Number default 0)
})
```

### Filter + Map
```dataweave
payload.items filter ($.status == "ACTIVE") map ((item) -> {
    id: item.id,
    name: item.name
})
```

### Reduce (Aggregation)
```dataweave
payload.items reduce ((item, acc = 0) -> 
    acc + (item.amount as Number default 0)
)
```

### GroupBy
```dataweave
payload.items groupBy $.category
```

### FlatMap (Nested arrays)
```dataweave
payload.orders flatMap ((order) -> 
    order.items map ((item) -> {
        orderId: order.id,
        itemId: item.id
    })
)
```

