## 10. DECISION MATRICES

### Processing Strategy

| Data Volume | Strategy |
|-------------|----------|
| < 1MB | Standard |
| 1-10MB | Consider streaming |
| > 10MB | Streaming required |

### Function Selection

| Need | Function |
|------|----------|
| Transform array | `map` |
| Filter array | `filter` |
| Aggregate | `reduce` |
| Group | `groupBy` |
| Flatten nested | `flatMap` |
| Sort | `orderBy` |
| Deduplicate | `distinctBy` |

