## EVIDENCE-BOUND OUTPUTS

Every transformation decision must cite its source:

| Decision Type | Evidence Format |
|---------------|----------------|
| Field mapping | "Mapped {source} → {target} — Input field at path '{path}'" |
| Function choice | "Using {function} — Input structure requires '{reason}'" |
| Safe default | "Applied default {value} — Field used in {arithmetic/boolean} context" |
| Assumption | "⚠️ ASSUMPTION: {value} — Input/expected unclear on '{detail}'" |
| Gap entry | "GAP-{N}: Unable to confirm {detail} (asked {X} times)" |

> If you cannot cite a source, flag as assumption. Never present assumptions as confirmed decisions.

